{"id":"f038e6f0c0223f39","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Frame Homomorphism","display":"df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism — ZFC Order9 Frame Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism — ZFC Order9 Frame Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top7-frame.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism — ZFC Order9 Frame Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"925a3a1f25b1a36b\" href=\"?note=925a3a1f25b1a36b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top7-frame.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top7-frame.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,M,R_L,R_M,j_L,j_M,m_L,m_M\\in V\">\\(L,M,R_L,R_M,j_L,j_M,m_L,m_M\\in V\\)</span> (frame carriers, orders, joins, and binary meets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span> (frame homomorphism graph candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S\\)</span> (frame predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9FrameHomomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9FrameHomomorphism}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}frame\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9FrameHomomorphism}_S(f,L,R_L,j_L,m_L,M,R_M,j_M,m_M)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(L,R_L,j_L,m_L)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(M,R_M,j_M,m_M)\\land \\operatorname{Function}(f,L,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land f(j_L(L))=j_M(M)\n\\land \\forall x,y\\in L\\;f(m_L(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=m_M(\\langle f(x),f(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land \\forall A\\subseteq L\\;f(j_L(A))=j_M(\\{f(a):a\\in A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}frame\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9FrameHomomorphism}_S(f,L,R_L,j_L,m_L,M,R_M,j_M,m_M)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(L,R_L,j_L,m_L)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(M,R_M,j_M,m_M)\\land \\operatorname{Function}(f,L,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land f(j_L(L))=j_M(M)\n\\land \\forall x,y\\in L\\;f(m_L(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=m_M(\\langle f(x),f(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land \\forall A\\subseteq L\\;f(j_L(A))=j_M(\\{f(a):a\\in A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_L(L)\">\\(j_L(L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_M(M)\">\\(j_M(M)\\)</span> are the top elements; the function image is set-bounded, and the last clauses preserve binary meets and arbitrary joins.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top7-frame.md","status":"resolved","id":"925a3a1f25b1a36b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top7-frame.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,M,R_L,R_M,j_L,j_M,m_L,m_M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9FrameHomomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}frame\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9FrameHomomorphism}_S(f,L,R_L,j_L,m_L,M,R_M,j_M,m_M)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(L,R_L,j_L,m_L)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(M,R_M,j_M,m_M)\\land \\operatorname{Function}(f,L,M)\\\\\n&\\quad \\land f(j_L(L))=j_M(M)\n\\land \\forall x,y\\in L\\;f(m_L(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=m_M(\\langle f(x),f(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\quad \\land \\forall A\\subseteq L\\;f(j_L(A))=j_M(\\{f(a):a\\in A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"j_L(L)","display":false},{"tex":"j_M(M)","display":false}],"bytes":1434,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2972","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism.md|58-df-zfc-order9-frame-homomorphism]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","925a3a1f25b1a36b"]}